Value Required TABLE (\S+)
Value DESTINATIONS (\d+)
Value TOTAL_ROUTES (\d+)
Value ACTIVE_ROUTES (\d+)
Value HOLDDOWN (\d+)
Value HIDDEN (\d+)

Start
  ^${TABLE}:\s+${DESTINATIONS}\s+destinations,\s+${TOTAL_ROUTES}\s+routes\s+\(${ACTIVE_ROUTES}\s+active,\s+${HOLDDOWN}\s+holddown,\s+${HIDDEN}\s+hidden\)\s*$$ -> Record
